== 修正 Newton 法 <s-mnewton>

#flow(title: [做法（教材 3.3.3）])[
  + $G_k$ 奇异：取 $p_k = -g_k$，作直线搜索 $x_(k+1) = "ls"(x_k, p_k)$。
  + $G_k$ 非奇异：解 $G_k p_k = -g_k$，先取 $x_(k+1) = x_k + p_k$。若 $f(x_(k+1)) < f(x_k)$，迭代有效。
  + 若 $f(x_(k+1)) >= f(x_k)$，看 $g_k^T p_k$：
    - $g_k^T p_k approx 0$（$p_k$ 与 $g_k$ 几乎垂直）：改取 $p_k = -g_k$，作直线搜索；
    - $g_k^T p_k < 0$（Newton 方向是下降方向）：沿 $p_k$ 作直线搜索；
    - $g_k^T p_k > 0$（Newton 方向是上升方向）：沿 $-p_k$ 作直线搜索。
  + 直线搜索：令 $phi(t) = f(x_k + t p_k)$，解 $phi'(t) = 0$ 取使 $phi$ 最小的正根 $t_k$，$x_(k+1) = x_k + t_k p_k$。
]

#exam-q("2024-2025A", "三")
#ans[
  #step[梯度和 Hesse 矩阵]
  $ g(x) = vec(2 x_1 - x_2^2, 2 x_2 - 2 x_1 x_2), quad G(x) = mat(2, -2 x_2; -2 x_2, 2 - 2 x_1). $

  #step[(1) $x_0 = (2, 0)^T$]
  $ f(x_0) &= 4, quad g_0 = (4, 0)^T, quad G_0 = mat(2, 0; 0, -2) " 非奇异", \
    p_0 &= -G_0^(-1) g_0 = -(4/2, 0)^T = (-2, 0)^T, \
    x_0 + p_0 &= (0, 0)^T, quad f = 0 < 4. $
  迭代有效。

  #concl[$x^((1)) = (0, 0)^T$（正好是极小点）。]

  #step[(2) $x_0 = (1, -1)^T$]
  $ f(x_0) &= 1, quad g_0 = (1, 0)^T, quad G_0 = mat(2, 2; 2, 0), quad det G_0 = -4, \
    G_0^(-1) &= -1/4 mat(0, -2; -2, 2) = mat(0, 1/2; 1/2, -1/2), \
    p_0 &= -G_0^(-1) g_0 = (0, -1/2)^T, \
    x_0 + p_0 &= (1, -3/2)^T, quad f = 1 + 9/4 - 9/4 = 1. $
  函数值没有下降，迭代无效。又
  $ g_0^T p_0 = 0, $
  Newton 方向与梯度垂直，改取 $p_0 = -g_0 = (-1, 0)^T$ 作直线搜索：
  $ phi(t) &= f(1 - t, -1) = (1 - t)^2 - (1 - t) + 1, \
    phi'(t) &= -2 (1 - t) + 1 = 0 quad => quad t_0 = 1/2. $

  #concl[$x^((1)) = (1/2, -1)^T$，$f(x^((1))) = 3/4$。]

  #step[(3) $x_0 = (1/3, sqrt(2/3))^T$]
  $ g_0 &= (2/3 - 2/3, 4/3 sqrt(2/3))^T = (0, 4/9 sqrt(6))^T, \
    G_0 &= mat(2, -2/3 sqrt(6); -2/3 sqrt(6), 4/3), quad det G_0 = 8/3 - 8/3 = 0. $
  $G_0$ 奇异，取 $p_0 = -g_0 = (0, -4/9 sqrt(6))^T$。此时 $x_2 = sqrt(6)/3 (1 - 4/3 t)$，
  $ phi(t) &= f(1/3, sqrt(6)/3 (1 - 4/3 t)) = 1/9 + 4/9 (1 - 4/3 t)^2 = 64/81 t^2 - 32/27 t + 5/9, \
    phi'(t) &= 128/81 t - 32/27 = 0 quad => quad t_0 = 3/4. $

  #concl[$x^((1)) = (1/3, 0)^T$，$f(x^((1))) = 1/9 < f(x_0) = 5/9$。]
]

#exam-q("2024-2025B", "三")
#ans[
  #step[梯度和 Hesse 矩阵]
  $ g(x) = vec(x_1 - 2 x_1 x_2, 2 x_2 - x_1^2), quad G(x) = mat(1 - 2 x_2, -2 x_1; -2 x_1, 2). $

  #step[(1) $overline(x)_0 = (0, -1)^T$]
  $ f(overline(x)_0) &= 1, quad g_0 = (0, -2)^T, quad G_0 = mat(3, 0; 0, 2), \
    p_0 &= -G_0^(-1) g_0 = -(0, -2/2)^T = (0, 1)^T, \
    overline(x)_0 + p_0 &= (0, 0)^T, quad f = 0 < 1. $
  迭代有效。

  #concl[$overline(x)_1 = (0, 0)^T$。]

  #step[(2) $overline(x)_0 = (1/sqrt(3), 1/6)^T$]
  $ g_0 &= (1/sqrt(3) - 1/(3 sqrt(3)), 1/3 - 1/3)^T = (2/9 sqrt(3), 0)^T, \
    G_0 &= mat(2/3, -2/sqrt(3); -2/sqrt(3), 2), quad det G_0 = 4/3 - 4/3 = 0. $
  $G_0$ 奇异，取 $p_0 = -g_0 = (-2/9 sqrt(3), 0)^T$。此时 $x_1 = sqrt(3)/3 (1 - 2/3 t)$，
  $ phi(t) &= f(sqrt(3)/3 (1 - 2/3 t), 1/6) = 1/9 (1 - 2/3 t)^2 + 1/36 = 4/81 t^2 - 4/27 t + 5/36, \
    phi'(t) &= 8/81 t - 4/27 = 0 quad => quad t_0 = 3/2. $

  #concl[$overline(x)_1 = (0, 1/6)^T$，$f(overline(x)_1) = 1/36 < f(overline(x)_0) = 5/36$。]

  #step[(3) $overline(x)_0 = (2, 1/2)^T$]
  $ f(overline(x)_0) &= 1/4, quad g_0 = (0, -3)^T, quad G_0 = mat(0, -4; -4, 2), quad det G_0 = -16, \
    G_0^(-1) &= -1/16 mat(2, 4; 4, 0) = mat(-1/8, -1/4; -1/4, 0), \
    p_0 &= -G_0^(-1) g_0 = -(3/4, 0)^T = (-3/4, 0)^T, \
    overline(x)_0 + p_0 &= (5/4, 1/2)^T, quad f = 25/32 + 1/4 - 25/32 = 1/4. $
  函数值没有下降，迭代无效。$g_0^T p_0 = 0$，改取 $p_0 = -g_0 = (0, 3)^T$。记 $v = 1/2 + 3 t$：
  $ phi(t) = f(2, v) = v^2 - 4 v + 2, $
  $v = 2$ 时最小，即 $t_0 = 1/2$。

  #concl[$overline(x)_1 = (2, 2)^T$，$f(overline(x)_1) = -2 < 1/4$。]
]

#exam-q("2023-2024", "四")
#ans[
  #step[梯度和 Hesse 矩阵]
