  #step[梯度和 Hesse 矩阵]
  $ g(x) = (x_1^2 - 1, 2 x_2)^T, quad G(x) = mat(2 x_1, 0; 0, 2). $

  #step[(1) $x_0 = (2, 1)^T$]
  $ f(x_0) &= 5/3, quad g_0 = (3, 2)^T, quad G_0 = mat(4, 0; 0, 2), \
    p_0 &= -G_0^(-1) g_0 = (-3/4, -1)^T, \
    x_0 + p_0 &= (5/4, 0)^T, quad f = -115/192 < 5/3. $
  #concl[迭代有效，$x_1 = (5/4, 0)^T$。]

  #step[(2) $x_0 = (0, 0)^T$]
  $G_0 = mat(0, 0; 0, 2)$ 奇异，取 $p_0 = -g_0 = (1, 0)^T$：
  $ phi(t) = 1/3 t^3 - t, quad phi'(t) = t^2 - 1 = 0 quad => quad t_0 = 1. $
  #concl[$x_1 = (1, 0)^T$。]

  #step[(3) $x_0 = (-1/2, 0)^T$]
  $ f(x_0) &= 11/24, quad g_0 = (-3/4, 0)^T, quad G_0 = mat(-1, 0; 0, 2), \
    p_0 &= -G_0^(-1) g_0 = (-3/4, 0)^T, \
    x_0 + p_0 &= (-5/4, 0)^T, quad f = 115/192 > 11/24. $
  迭代无效。$g_0^T p_0 = 9/16 > 0$，上升方向，改沿 $-p_0 = (3/4, 0)^T$ 搜索：
  $ phi'(t) = 3/4 ((-1/2 + 3/4 t)^2 - 1) = 0 quad => quad t_0 = 2. $
  #concl[$x_1 = (1, 0)^T$。$(1, 0)^T$ 处 $g = 0$，$G = mat(2, 0; 0, 2)$ 正定，是 $f$ 的局部极小点。]
